# .gitattributes
#
# Closes WINDOWS.md ledger entry 1 (03.1-01 Task 3). This machine clones the
# repository with automatic carriage-return conversion, so the three
# committed schema artifacts under packages/schemas/schema/*.schema.json sit
# in the working tree with CRLF line endings while
# packages/schemas/scripts/generate-json-schema.ts always emits LF — and
# packages/schemas/src/json-schema.test.ts compares the two byte for byte.
# That drift test's strictness is the point (a schema regeneration drift
# must be caught); the fix is this checkout setting, not a looser test.

* text=auto
*.json text eol=lf
